  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planning design and technical assistance for the establishment of an integrated agro-food park in Kyrgyzstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ultimate objective of the project is to facilitate Kyrgyzstan becoming a leading supplier in the regional market and the Eurasian Economic Union market for high-quality organic agricultural products. The  intermediate objective is to facilitate the emergence of a robust agro-industrial sector in Kyrgyzstan. The project will do this through: the preparation of bankable project documents with which the Government of the Kyrgyz Republic and/or partners can approach financial institutions to raise required capital to finance off- and on-site infrastructure; and preparation of the documentation to support the Government of the Kyrgyz Republic in guiding the agro-park aspect of its development plans.  The project The IAFP will serve as one of the flagship initiatives in the framework of the Programme for Country Partnership (PCP) for the Kyrgyz Republic 2025-2029 jointly implemented by the Cabinet of Ministers and UNIDO.</narrative>
  </description>
